@model AcxiomCrm.Web.ViewModels.Opportunities.OpportunityDetailsViewModel
@using AcxiomCrm.Domain.Enums
@using AcxiomCrm.Domain.Rules
@using AcxiomCrm.Web.Presentation

@{
    var detail = Model.Detail;
    var rowVersionBase64 = Convert.ToBase64String(detail.RowVersion);
    var isOpen = detail.Status == OpportunityStatus.Open;
}

@if (isOpen && Model.CanEdit)
{
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-muted small fw-semibold me-1">Move stage:</span>

        @foreach (var stage in OpportunityRules.OpenStages)
        {
            if (stage != detail.Stage)
            {
                <form method="post" asp-action="ChangeStage" asp-route-id="@detail.Id" class="d-inline">
                    <input type="hidden" name="targetStage" value="@stage" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="rowVersion" value="@rowVersionBase64" />
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="btnStage-@stage">
                        @Labels.For(stage)
                    </button>
                </form>
            }
        }

        <button type="button" class="btn btn-success btn-sm" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#closeOppModal"
                data-stage="Won" data-title="Close as Won" data-note-label="Win reason &amp; deal summary" id="btnStageWon">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i> Close Won
        </button>

        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#closeOppModal"
                data-stage="Lost" data-title="Close as Lost" data-note-label="Loss reason" id="btnStageLost">
            <i class="bi bi-x-circle me-1"></i> Close Lost
        </button>
    </div>
}
